node_modules
dist
.env
.env.local
*.tsbuildinfo

# Native launcher-icon sources, regenerated from public/ SVGs by
# scripts/build-native-icons.mjs during the Android build.
assets

# Golf visual-QA screenshot output (headless harness)
.golf-shots/

# Baseball visual-QA screenshot output (headless harness). Not yet generated —
# added ahead of the harness so the first run cannot accidentally commit PNGs.
.baseball-shots/

# ...and any SIDECAR set. A visual comparison needs at least two directories —
# a before and an after — so reviewing a change reliably produces siblings like
# `.golf-shots-before/`, `-afterA/`, `-2048/`. The exact-name rules above do not
# catch those, and one such directory turned up as 29 MB of untracked PNGs that
# a commit-everything would happily have swallowed. Screenshots are evidence for
# a review, never repository content.
.golf-shots-*/
.baseball-shots-*/

# Agent scratch benches. Physics work needs throwaway harnesses (coefficient
# sweeps, mutation drivers, parameterised integrator clones) and they must live
# OUTSIDE src/: a review once left one under src/lib/baseball/ that broke
# `pnpm build` with a type error, while `pnpm typecheck` reported clean because
# turbo served a cache hit. Ignored here so a forgotten bench is noise rather
# than a commit — but delete them anyway when the work is done.
scratch/
